<title>AUSTRALIA: Cricket-Sheffield Shield scores.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Sheffield Shield scores.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores in the Sheffield Shield on Friday:</p>
<p>In Sydney (first day) - New South Wales 264 (Michael Bevan 79, Greg Matthews 45). Victoria 68-1.</p>
<p>In Brisbane (third day) - Queensland 244 (Geoff Foley 82 not out, Martin Love 46) and one for no wicket. Tasmania 168 and 176 (Tony Daly 42, Scott Muller 4-35, Adam Dale 4-44).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
